# The crew: one astronaut per player, one line per ship, in ship order.
# Edit names here and re-run tools/lvc.py; no code changes needed.
#
#   crew <name> ship <ship name> [quirk <quirk from fleet.lv>] [tag <word>]... [flagship]
#        [habit "<one sentence about {A}>"]
#
# Tags are optional flavour hooks for cards: `when tag A mech` only binds role A to crew
# carrying that tag. Use them to let a card *prefer* someone (pair it with an untagged
# twin), never to lock a whole storyline to one person. Tags never appear in card text.
#
# With no quirk, the astronaut's starting traits are seeded from the voyage key and
# their name, so they are stable from build to build but nobody picked them.
# Card text never assumes anyone's gender: use {A}/{B} or "they".
#
# Habits: one small, harmless, real detail per astronaut, sent in by that player and
# dropped in here. It is a whole sentence about {A}, e.g.
#   habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
# Cards marked `each crew` print it (one clone per astronaut, compiled in; the phone
# never sees a new slot). Until a real one arrives, everyone has the same generic
# placeholder below. Never invent a habit for a real person: leave the placeholder.

crew Phill     ship Ship 01   tag controls  flagship  habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
crew Jacques   ship Ship 02   tag controls           habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
crew Kim       ship Ship 03   tag controls           habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
crew Jai       ship Ship 04   tag controls           habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
crew Michelle  ship Ship 05   tag controls           habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
crew Diego     ship Ship 06   tag mech               habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
crew Dorian    ship Ship 07   tag controls           habit "{A} keeps one small thing from home within reach of the console."
